---
import samples from '../data/samples.json';
const {single=false}=Astro.props;const list=single?samples.filter(s=>s.id===6402):samples;const first=list[0];
---
<section id="compare" class="wrap compare-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / LOOK CLOSER</p><h2>One capture. Two renderings.</h2></div><p>Drag to compare the camera’s embedded JPEG preview<br class="desktop"/> with a developed RAW export.</p></div>
<div class="comparison" data-samples={JSON.stringify(list)}>
<div class="comparison-top"><div class="tabs" role="group" aria-label="Camera sample">{list.map((s,i)=><button type="button" data-id={s.id} aria-pressed={i===0}>{s.model==='ILCE-7M3'?'Sony A7 III':s.brand+' '+s.model.replace('EOS ','')}</button>)}</div><span class="sample-badge">REAL CAPTURE · CC0</span></div>
<div class="image-stage" style="--split:50%"><picture class="raw-picture"><source srcset={`/images/${first.id}-raw.webp`} type="image/webp"/><img src={`/images/${first.id}-raw.jpg`} width="1200" height="800" alt={`Developed RAW export from ${first.brand} ${first.model}`} fetchpriority="high"/></picture><picture class="jpeg-picture"><source srcset={`/images/${first.id}-jpeg.webp`} type="image/webp"/><img src={`/images/${first.id}-jpeg.jpg`} width="1200" height="800" alt={`Embedded JPEG preview from ${first.brand} ${first.model}`}/></picture><span class="image-label left">CAMERA JPEG PREVIEW</span><span class="image-label right">DEVELOPED RAW</span><div class="split-line"><span>↔</span></div><input class="comparison-range" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="50" aria-label="JPEG preview coverage" aria-valuetext="50 percent JPEG preview"/></div>
<div class="comparison-bottom"><span class="sample-caption">{first.brand} {first.model} · {first.mode}</span><span>← Drag the divider →</span><a class="sample-source" href={first.url}>Original RAW ↗</a></div></div>
<p class="honesty"><strong>What you’re seeing:</strong> a camera preview versus a RAW developed with camera white balance. Preview resolution and processing differ. This is a rendering comparison, not a controlled test of highlight recovery or format superiority. <a href="/methodology/">See the exact method →</a></p></section>
<script>
 document.querySelectorAll('.comparison').forEach(root=>{const samples=JSON.parse(root.getAttribute('data-samples')||'[]');const range=root.querySelector('input')!;const stage=root.querySelector('.image-stage') as HTMLElement;function update(){stage.style.setProperty('--split',range.value+'%');range.setAttribute('aria-valuetext',range.value+' percent JPEG preview');}range.addEventListener('input',update);root.querySelectorAll('button[data-id]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{const s=samples.find((s:any)=>s.id===Number(button.getAttribute('data-id')));root.querySelectorAll('button').forEach(b=>b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(b===button)));['raw','jpeg'].forEach(type=>{const picture=root.querySelector('.'+type+'-picture')!;picture.querySelector('source')!.srcset=`/images/${s.id}-${type}.webp`;const img=picture.querySelector('img')!;img.src=`/images/${s.id}-${type}.jpg`;img.alt=`${type==='raw'?'Developed RAW export':'Embedded JPEG preview'} from ${s.brand} ${s.model}`;});root.querySelector('.sample-caption')!.textContent=`${s.brand} ${s.model} · ${s.mode}`;(root.querySelector('.sample-source') as HTMLAnchorElement).href=s.url;range.value='50';update();}));});
</script>
